  <h1>Avalanche Build Grant Application: Sivan Technologies</h1>
  
  <div class="highlight-box">
    <strong>Project Summary:</strong> Sivan is a WhatsApp-based project and service coordination software platform. By integrating the Avalanche C-Chain, Sivan enables international buyers to fund service agreements in Avalanche USDC while local freelancers and service providers receive their settlements directly in local fiat (Naira) straight to their bank accounts. No wallet setup, no gas management—just WhatsApp.
  </div>

